WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.432
The school asks you to prepare for posterior, high-lateral and LBBB-related findings, then integrate atypical or incomplete presentations. This workshop makes those tasks explicit.
学校要求准备后壁、高侧壁及LBBB相关发现，再整合非典型或资料不全表现。本实训把这些任务具体展开。

00:00:12.432 --> 00:00:22.296
Use the earlier lead placement and rhythm framework. We now add the measurements and limitations that stop a confident but incorrect interpretation.
要调用此前导联定位及心律框架，现在增加可防止自信误判的测量及局限。

00:00:22.296 --> 00:00:31.752
A pattern can justify urgent concern without proving one culprit artery. A negative special rule also cannot make an unstable patient safe.
模式可支持紧急怀疑，却不证明某责任动脉。特殊规则阴性，也不能使不稳定患者变安全。

00:00:31.752 --> 00:00:43.296
Describe what is present, how reliable it is and what action follows through the actual regional pathway. These original exercises are not school examination strips or answers.
应描述有何发现、可靠程度及真实区域路径下一行动。这里原创练习，不是学校考试条带或答案。

00:00:43.296 --> 00:00:57.264
Ischemia may present with pressure, breathlessness, weakness, nausea or syncope rather than a complete classic story. An incomplete history is a reason to assess, not a reason to exclude.
缺血可表现压迫、气促、无力、恶心或晕厥，而非完整经典故事。病史不全是继续评估理由，不是排除理由。

00:00:57.264 --> 00:01:06.792
Describe the actual symptoms and time course. The current chest-pain approach discourages using atypical as a dismissive shortcut.
应描述实际症状及时间线。现行胸痛思路不鼓励用非典型这个词作轻视捷径。

00:01:06.792 --> 00:01:18.720
Look for poor output, heart failure and dangerous alternatives while obtaining the useful ECG. No individual examination finding proves or excludes coronary ischemia.
取得有用ECG时，要找低心排、心衰及危险鉴别。没有单项体检能证明或排除冠脉缺血。

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:32.280
Ask what would change the immediate plan: shock, ongoing symptoms, electrical instability or a concerning evolving trace. Do not spend the encounter collecting risk factors while function fails.
要问何事会改即时计划：休克、持续症状、电不稳定或可疑变化记录。不能功能失败时，仍把接触都花在收风险因素。

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:41.808
Confirm the patient, time and symptom or treatment state. A technically valid old tracing is not necessarily the current physiological picture.
需确认患者、时间及症状治疗状态。技术有效的旧记录，不一定代表当前生理。

00:01:41.808 --> 00:01:52.488
Use actual landmarks and correct lead identity. Misplaced precordial or reversed limb electrodes can create misleading territory and conduction appearances.
应依真实标志及正确导联身份。胸前错位或肢体电极反接，可制造误导区域和传导外观。

00:01:52.488 --> 00:02:03.792
Reduce correctable artifact and inspect the baseline before measuring a tiny J-point difference. A machine interpretation is a prompt for review, not a quality guarantee.
测微小J点差前，应减少可纠正伪差并检查基线。机器解释是复核提示，不是质量保证。

00:02:03.792 --> 00:02:13.392
Keep all useful recordings with times and placement labels. Never discard the standard trace merely because supplemental leads have been acquired.
应保存全部有用记录、时间及定位标签。取得补充导联后，也不能丢标准记录。

00:02:13.392 --> 00:02:24.144
At standard gain, one millimeter corresponds to zero point one millivolt. Check the actual gain and paper speed before using remembered grid dimensions.
标准增益下一毫米为0.1毫伏。使用记忆方格尺寸前，要核真实增益纸速。

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:34.080
Locate QRS onset and the J point at the end of QRS. Baseline drift and an indistinct end can make a small measurement unreliable.
应找QRS起点及结束处J点。基线漂移或结束不清，会让小测量不可靠。

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:45.384
The universal-definition reference uses QRS onset for J-point comparison in the acute setting. Do not accidentally measure the T-wave peak or use a moving baseline as the reference.
通用定义参考在急性情况用QRS起点作J点比较。不能错测T峰，或用漂移基线作参考。

00:02:45.384 --> 00:02:55.128
State the measured finding and uncertainty. A threshold only helps when the calibration, anatomy and clinical setting match the rule being used.
应说明测量发现及不确定。只有校准、解剖背景及临床情境匹配规则，阈值才有帮助。

00:02:55.128 --> 00:03:05.016
Group the views by anatomy rather than their printed adjacency. Two boxes next to each other on the page are not automatically contiguous leads.
需按解剖分组，而非纸上邻近。两个挨着的打印框，不自动是解剖相邻导联。

00:03:05.016 --> 00:03:17.496
Inferior Two, Three and a V F are a familiar group. One and a V L examine high lateral regions, with V Five and V Six providing related lateral views.
II、III及aVF是熟悉下壁组。I及aVL看高侧壁，V5及V6提供相关侧壁视角。

00:03:17.496 --> 00:03:28.512
Precordial territories overlap; use a consistent learned map without pretending each electrode sees one isolated wall or uniquely identifies an artery.
胸前区域有重叠。应使用一致学过地图，但不能假装每电极只看孤立壁，或唯一认定动脉。

00:03:28.512 --> 00:03:39.672
Supplemental leads change the view and must be labelled. A trace acquired after moving electrodes cannot be compared as if every lead position remained standard.
补充导联改变视角，必须标注。移动电极后的记录，不能当每个位置仍是标准而直接比较。

00:03:39.672 --> 00:03:50.784
For conventional criteria, new or presumed-new elevation must be assessed in anatomically contiguous leads with the correct context, not in one isolated spike.
普通标准需在解剖相邻导联及正确背景中评新或推定新抬高，不能只看一个孤立尖峰。

00:03:50.784 --> 00:04:02.472
The usual one-millimeter cutoff does not apply unchanged to V Two and V Three. In men forty or older the cutoff there is two millimeters, and under forty it is two point five.
常规一毫米阈值不能原样套V2及V3。男性至少40岁时，该处二毫米；不足40岁为二点五。

00:04:02.472 --> 00:04:15.264
For women, the cited V Two and V Three cutoff is one point five millimeters. The complete rule still includes lead relationships and relevant conduction or hypertrophy context.
引用标准中女性V2及V3阈值一点五毫米。完整规则仍包括导联关系及相关传导或肥厚背景。

00:04:15.264 --> 00:04:26.400
Lesser changes can still be important with symptoms or reciprocal findings. Failure to meet conventional elevation criteria does not exclude acute coronary occlusion.
较小改变结合症状或镜像发现，仍可能重要。不满足普通抬高标准，不能排急性冠脉闭塞。

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:34.944
State the abnormal leads and the kind of change before naming a territory. This keeps the interpretation traceable to the evidence.
应先说异常导联及改变类型，再说区域，令解释可追溯到证据。

00:04:34.944 --> 00:04:45.096
Reciprocal depression can support concern but is not required in every true event. No mirror change does not make a concerning elevation harmless.
镜像压低可支持怀疑，但每个真实事件不一定都有。无镜像，不能让可疑抬高变无害。

00:04:45.096 --> 00:04:55.728
Coronary anatomy varies and regional views overlap. A territory is not proof of a particular culprit vessel or the exact size and age of infarction.
冠脉解剖会变，区域视角也重叠。区域不证明某责任血管，或梗死准确大小和年龄。

00:04:55.728 --> 00:05:07.224
Communicate the pattern and patient-linked urgency through the actual pathway. Do not delay the alert while trying to prove anatomy that only definitive investigation can establish.
应依真实路径沟通模式及联系患者的紧急度。不能为证明只有确定检查能建立的解剖，而推迟预警。

00:05:07.224 --> 00:05:17.088
The standard tracing has limited direct posterior views. Horizontal depression in V One through V Three can be a reciprocal clue to posterior injury.
标准记录缺乏直接后壁视角。V1至V3水平压低，可为后壁损伤的镜像线索。

00:05:17.088 --> 00:05:26.688
A prominent broad R wave, an R-to-S ratio above one in V Two and upright anterior T waves can support the pattern in the appropriate context.
合适背景中，突出宽R、V2中R比S大，以及前方T直立，可支持该模式。

00:05:26.688 --> 00:05:37.656
These findings are not specific alone and may not all be present early. Do not require a complete memorized triad before taking ongoing ischemic symptoms seriously.
这些单独不特异，早期也未必全部出现。不能非等背诵三联完整，才重视持续缺血症状。

00:05:37.656 --> 00:05:50.928
Acquire indicated trained posterior views and seek appropriate urgent interpretation/pathway support. The absence of ordinary anterior elevation is not a reassuring conclusion.
应依指征取得受训后壁导联，并寻适当紧急判读路径支持。没有普通前方抬高，不是放心结论。

00:05:50.928 --> 00:06:03.384
Use the trained supplemental placement method. V Seven lies at the left posterior axillary line, V Eight at the left midscapular line and V Nine at the left paraspinal border.
应使用受训补充定位法。V7在左腋后线，V8左肩胛中线，V9左脊旁缘。

00:06:03.384 --> 00:06:12.600
Maintain the horizontal posterior level specified by the reference and actual protocol, rather than following the changing scapular tip down the back.
应依参考及真实规程维持后方同一水平，不能沿会随体位变化的肩胛尖往下放。

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:24.528
If existing cables are repositioned, label the new positions clearly on the actual recording. Do not leave the receiver to interpret posterior positions as standard V Four to V Six.
若重放既有线，应在真实记录清楚标新位置。不能让接收者把后方位置误读为标准V4至V6。

00:06:24.528 --> 00:06:36.048
Preserve the standard ECG and both acquisition times. Obtain useful additional views without abandoning treatment of instability or delaying necessary communication.
需保存标准ECG及两次时间。补有用视角时，不能放弃不稳定照护或延误必要沟通。

00:06:36.048 --> 00:06:50.088
The cited universal-definition section gives a half-millimeter posterior elevation cutoff, with one millimeter used for men younger than forty. These are supplemental-view criteria, not a new rule for every standard lead.
引用通用定义节给后壁抬高半毫米阈值，不足40岁男性用一毫米。这是补充视角标准，不能变成所有标准导联的新规则。

00:06:50.088 --> 00:07:00.288
A small signal demands a reliable baseline, correct placement and calibration. Do not manufacture precision from a moving or poor-quality tracing.
小信号需要可靠基线、正确定位校准。不能从晃动差记录中制造精确。

00:07:00.288 --> 00:07:12.096
The downloaded twenty-twenty-two table prints a less-than-or-equal sign in this posterior item. It conflicts with the threshold concept and is not taught as a maximum allowed elevation.
下载的2022表在后壁项目印小于等于号，与阈值概念冲突，因此不教成允许抬高的最大值。

00:07:12.096 --> 00:07:24.696
The local notification and destination process still applies. High concern with ongoing symptoms or instability deserves escalation even when a supplemental trace is not definitive.
仍须依当地通知及目的地流程。持续症状或不稳定伴高度怀疑时，即使补导联不确定，也需升级。

00:07:24.696 --> 00:07:33.384
Posterior signals may be small and disease evolves. A nondiagnostic extra recording is not a universal rule-out test.
后壁信号可能小，疾病也会变化。一份无诊断性的额外记录，不是通用排除测试。

00:07:33.384 --> 00:07:44.928
Check placement, quality and acquisition timing, then compare genuine serial changes. Do not repeatedly move electrodes and call every difference physiological evolution.
应核定位、质量及采集时间，再比真实串联变化。不能不断移电极，却把每个差异都称生理演变。

00:07:44.928 --> 00:07:58.224
Anterior depression can have other explanations, including wider ischemia or conduction-related changes. Describe the observations and alternatives rather than declaring posterior infarction from one sign.
前方压低也可由更广缺血或传导相关改变等解释。应描述观察及鉴别，不能一征就宣布后壁梗死。

00:07:58.224 --> 00:08:08.352
Continue appropriate patient support and timely expert review. Repeating tests must not become a reason to delay a necessary pre-alert or conveyance.
应持续适当支持及及时专家复核。不能用重复检测作延误必要预警或转运的理由。

00:08:08.352 --> 00:08:18.336
The school includes high-lateral patterns in its advanced list. Elevation in One and a V L can meet ordinary contiguous-lead STEMI criteria.
学校高级列表包括高侧壁模式。I及aVL抬高，可符合普通相邻导联STEMI标准。

00:08:18.336 --> 00:08:27.744
Review related lateral views and possible inferior reciprocal depression. These support localization but do not independently prove the culprit artery.
应看相关侧壁视角及可能下壁镜像压低。它们支持定位，却不能独立证明责任动脉。

00:08:27.744 --> 00:08:39.912
Subtle isolated findings need quality and clinical correlation, not a forced equivalent label. Do not ignore a small but concerning change simply because another lead looks normal.
细微局部发现需质量及临床联系，不能强贴等价型。也不能因另导联正常，就忽视小但可疑改变。

00:08:39.912 --> 00:08:52.200
Use the actual alert pathway and communicate the abnormal views, symptom state and stability. Classification should help timely care, not become an argument that delays it.
应走真实预警路径，沟通异常视角、症状及稳定度。分类应帮助及时照护，而非变成延误争论。

00:08:52.200 --> 00:09:02.064
A wide QRS means ventricular activation takes longer. It does not alone prove LBBB, RBBB or ventricular tachycardia.
宽QRS表示心室激动更久，单独不证明LBBB、RBBB或室速。

00:09:02.064 --> 00:09:13.872
Pacing, pre-excitation, electrolyte/drug effects and other conduction disease can also produce a broad complex. Artifact may further confuse the apparent width.
起搏、预激、电解质药效及其他传导病，也可宽波；伪差还会混淆表观宽度。

00:09:13.872 --> 00:09:23.928
Use the measured duration, morphology, rhythm and atrioventricular relationships. Check the whole lead set rather than one memorable shape.
应使用测得时限、形态、心律及房室关系，看全套导联，不只一个好记形状。

00:09:23.928 --> 00:09:33.696
Assess pulse and perfusion promptly. An unstable wide-complex patient needs the appropriate urgent pathway while the interpretation is refined.
应及时评脉及灌注。不稳定宽波患者需适当紧急路径，判读可同时继续完善。

00:09:33.696 --> 00:09:43.200
The cited adult complete-RBBB definition includes a QRS of at least one hundred twenty milliseconds. The duration alone is insufficient.
引用成人完全RBBB定义包括QRS至少120毫秒，但时限单独不够。

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:54.792
Look for the specified terminal R-prime patterns in V One or V Two, with a broad terminal S in One and V Six. Recognize that real morphology has variants.
应看V1或V2规定的终末R撇模式，以及I和V6宽终末S，并知道真实形态有变体。

00:09:54.792 --> 00:10:05.472
The full definition also considers R-peak timing. Do not reduce it to a cartoon of rabbit ears or infer a diagnosis from one misplaced right-precordial lead.
完整定义还考虑R峰时间。不能简化成兔耳简图，或从一个错位右胸导联推诊断。

00:10:05.472 --> 00:10:18.504
RBBB is a conduction description, not automatic infarction, embolism or atrioventricular block. New symptoms and perfusion changes still need an urgent clinical explanation.
RBBB是传导描述，不自动是梗死、栓塞或房室阻滞。新症状及灌注变化仍需紧急临床解释。

00:10:18.504 --> 00:10:29.832
The cited adult complete-LBBB definition begins with QRS at least one hundred twenty milliseconds and characteristic broad, notched or slurred lateral R waves.
引用成人完全LBBB定义，以QRS至少120毫秒及特征性侧壁宽、切迹或顿挫R开始。

00:10:29.832 --> 00:10:40.512
The complete morphology includes absent Q waves in One, V Five and V Six, with the stated a V L exception, and delayed lateral R-peak timing.
完整形态包括I、V5及V6无Q，aVL有所列例外，并有侧壁R峰延迟。

00:10:40.512 --> 00:10:51.312
ST and T usually oppose the dominant QRS direction. These secondary changes make ordinary ischemia reading harder; not every elevation is primary injury.
ST及T通常与主QRS方向相反。继发改变使普通缺血阅读更难，并非每个抬高都是原发损伤。

00:10:51.312 --> 00:11:05.976
Use the whole pattern and clinical context rather than the machine label alone. Alternative LBBB definitions exist for specialist purposes, so do not import a CRT threshold into this basic recognition task.
应依整体模式及临床背景，不只机器标签。专科目的可用其他LBBB定义，不能把CRT阈值移到此基础识别任务。

00:11:05.976 --> 00:11:16.584
Atrioventricular block describes impaired conduction from atria toward ventricles. Bundle-branch block describes delayed spread within the ventricular conduction system.
房室阻滞描述心房向心室传导受损；束支阻滞描述心室传导系统内传播延迟。

00:11:16.584 --> 00:11:27.816
They can coexist, but a wide QRS does not establish complete AV block. Inspect atrial activity and its relationship to conducted ventricular beats.
两者可并存，但宽QRS不能确立完全房室阻滞。需看心房活动及其与传导心室搏动关系。

00:11:27.816 --> 00:11:40.248
Likewise, a two-to-one pattern cannot always be called Mobitz Two from one strip. Describe the observed relationship and seek appropriate review without delaying unstable-patient care.
同样，二比一模式不总能凭一条带叫Mobitz II。应描述观察关系并寻适当复核，不能延误不稳定照护。

00:11:40.248 --> 00:11:51.528
The practical endpoint is a useful description of rate, rhythm, conduction and perfusion. A more precise label is valuable only when it improves the decision.
实操终点是有用描述频率、心律、传导及灌注。更精确标签，只有改善决定才有价值。

00:11:51.528 --> 00:12:01.200
Concordance means that the ST displacement and dominant QRS point in the same direction. A positive QRS with elevation is one example.
同向是ST偏移与主QRS朝同方向，正QRS伴抬高就是一例。

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:11.784
Discordance means opposite directions. In LBBB, some discordant ST-T change is expected because activation and repolarization have changed.
不一致是方向相反。LBBB因激动复极改变，部分反向ST及T是预期现象。

00:12:11.784 --> 00:12:21.072
Expected does not mean unlimited. The amount relative to the preceding complex and the clinical context can make a discordant finding concerning.
预期不代表无限。相对前面波群的程度及临床背景，可让反向发现变可疑。

00:12:21.072 --> 00:12:31.920
Use the schematic to understand direction, then measure on a real calibrated trace. A teaching drawing is not enough to diagnose LBBB or acute occlusion.
先用示意理解方向，再在真实校准记录测。教学图不足以诊断LBBB或急性闭塞。

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:42.936
The school lists LBBB among advanced equivalent concerns. The important correction is that new or presumed-new LBBB alone is not diagnostic of acute MI.
学校把LBBB列高级等价型关注。重要纠正是，新或推定新LBBB单独不诊断急性梗死。

00:12:42.936 --> 00:12:55.032
A previous tracing can help establish whether the pattern changed, but obtaining it must not delay urgent care. If no old trace exists, say that newness is unknown.
旧记录可帮助确认模式有无改变，但取旧图不能延误紧急照护。没有旧图时，应说新旧未知。

00:12:55.032 --> 00:13:07.032
Assess ongoing ischemic symptoms, perfusion and specific concerning ST relationships. LBBB can indicate underlying structural disease even without acute occlusion.
需评持续缺血症状、灌注及特定可疑ST关系。没有急性闭塞时，LBBB也可提示基础结构病。

00:13:07.032 --> 00:13:18.504
Urgently escalate an unstable or persistently symptomatic patient through the actual pathway. A negative special score is not a discharge or non-conveyance certificate.
不稳定或持续有症状者，应依真实路径紧急升级。特殊分数阴性，不是出院或不转运证明。

00:13:18.504 --> 00:13:26.904
The cited framework treats concordant elevation of at least one millimeter in a lead with a positive QRS as an important finding.
引用框架把正QRS导联中至少一毫米同向抬高，视为重要发现。

00:13:26.904 --> 00:13:37.728
It also identifies concordant depression of at least one millimeter in V One to V Three. Confirm direction and baseline rather than merely seeing any depression.
也识别V1至V3至少一毫米同向压低。应确认方向基线，不能只见任何压低即可。

00:13:37.728 --> 00:13:48.216
These rules are discussed for LBBB or the appropriate ventricular-paced context. They are not a universal score for every conduction pattern or wide tachycardia.
这些规则用于LBBB或适当心室起搏背景，不是所有传导模式或宽快心律通用评分。

00:13:48.216 --> 00:13:58.200
Positive findings support urgent concern; their absence does not exclude occlusion. Continue patient-linked assessment and timely expert review.
阳性支持紧急担忧，缺如不能排闭塞。仍需联系患者评估及及时专家复核。

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:08.520
Original Sgarbossa assigns five points for concordant elevation, three for concordant anterior depression and two for the absolute discordant-elevation item.
原Sgarbossa对同向抬高计五分，同向前方压低三分，绝对反向抬高项二分。

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:18.984
A score at least three is positive in the cited framework. You do not need all three items; the two-point item alone is not the same as reaching the score threshold.
引用框架总至少三分为阳性，不需要三项都有。二分项单独也不等于达到总分阈值。

00:14:18.984 --> 00:14:29.736
The absolute five-millimeter discordant item has limitations when the preceding QRS is very large or small. This motivates the proportional modification.
当前面QRS很大或很小时，绝对五毫米反向项有局限，因此引出比例改良。

00:14:29.736 --> 00:14:39.024
Do not combine original points with modified items into a new hybrid score. State which framework you used and seek review when uncertain.
不能把原分数与改良项目混成新评分。应说明所用框架，不确定时寻复核。

00:14:39.024 --> 00:14:47.952
Smith-modified Sgarbossa keeps the concordant findings and replaces the absolute discordant-elevation item with a proportional measurement.
Smith改良保留同向发现，把绝对反向抬高项改为比例测量。

00:14:47.952 --> 00:14:57.240
In the cited table, the J-point elevation must be at least one millimeter and at least one quarter of the preceding S-wave depth.
引用表要求J点抬高至少一毫米，且至少为前面S波深度四分之一。

00:14:57.240 --> 00:15:07.584
Use the magnitude of the S-wave depth as the denominator, measured from the proper reference. It is not a T-wave ratio or the height of the tallest R elsewhere.
分母用从适当参考测得的S波深度绝对值，不是T波比，也不是其他处最高R。

00:15:07.584 --> 00:15:20.448
The modified rule is positive if any qualifying item is present, not by adding the original weights. It supports an urgent interpretation pathway, not independent proof of one artery.
改良规则任一符合项即阳性，不是加原权重。它支持紧急判读路径，却不独立证明某动脉。

00:15:20.448 --> 00:15:30.552
Assume a calibrated interpretable LBBB-context lead has a preceding S wave twelve millimeters deep and J-point elevation four millimeters high.
假设可解释且校准的LBBB背景导联，前面S波深十二毫米，J点抬高四毫米。

00:15:30.552 --> 00:15:41.592
Divide four by twelve: the magnitude is about zero point three three, or thirty-three percent. Elevation also exceeds the one-millimeter minimum.
四除十二，绝对值约0.33，即百分之三十三，抬高也超过一毫米最低。

00:15:41.592 --> 00:15:53.184
That meets the proportional teaching item in this assumed example. If the S depth were twenty-four with the same four-millimeter elevation, the proportion would be about seventeen percent instead.
本假设例符合比例教学项。若同样四毫米抬高，但S深二十四，比值就约百分之十七。

00:15:53.184 --> 00:16:05.280
A real patient decision still requires the right context, whole trace, symptoms and pathway. The second example not meeting one item does not rule out coronary occlusion.
真实患者决定仍需正确背景、全图、症状及路径。第二例没满足一项，也不能排冠脉闭塞。

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:17.424
Before using the rule, verify the trace quality and the actual conduction context. Mislabelled pacing, artifact or an unclear baseline can invalidate the calculation.
用规则前需核记录质量及真实传导背景。起搏误标、伪差或基线不清，会使计算无效。

00:16:17.424 --> 00:16:27.648
The original criteria are specific but not sensitive enough to exclude acute occlusion. A negative result does not explain away ongoing symptoms or shock.
原标准特异，但敏感度不足以排急性闭塞。阴性不能搪塞持续症状或休克。

00:16:27.648 --> 00:16:37.920
Do not use an exact percentage as a substitute for judgment when measurements are uncertain. State the uncertainty and obtain a timely expert over-read.
测量不确定时，不能用精确百分比替代判断。应说明不确定并及时寻专家复读。

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:49.176
Keep treating the immediate patient threat and follow the real notification pathway. A classroom rule cannot authorize automatic bypass, thrombolysis or a new medication.
应持续处理即时威胁并依真实通知路径。课堂规则不授权自动绕行、溶栓或新药。

00:16:49.176 --> 00:17:00.576
Determine whether pacing is atrial, ventricular or another configuration and whether the trace is interpretable. A spike alone does not describe ventricular activation.
需判断心房、心室或其他起搏配置，以及图是否可解释。一个起搏钉，不能描述全部心室激动。

00:17:00.576 --> 00:17:10.008
Check actual capture and perfusion through the patient assessment. Electrical-looking capture does not by itself prove effective mechanical output.
应通过患者评估核真实夺获及灌注。看似电夺获，单独不证明有效机械输出。

00:17:10.008 --> 00:17:20.856
The cited ischemia framework includes an appropriate ventricular-paced context, but not every paced trace is identical to LBBB or suitable for automatic scoring.
引用缺血框架包括适当心室起搏背景，但不是每个起搏图都等于LBBB或适合自动评分。

00:17:20.856 --> 00:17:31.104
Describe the device context, symptoms and concerning findings, then seek appropriate review. Pacing does not make acute coronary disease impossible.
应描述装置背景、症状及可疑发现，再寻适当复核。起搏不能使急性冠脉病不可能。

00:17:31.104 --> 00:17:43.608
Hyperacute T changes can be early ischemic findings, but potassium disturbance and hypertrophy can also affect T waves. No tall T wave is automatically one diagnosis.
超急性T可为早期缺血发现，但钾紊乱和肥厚也影响T。并非所有高T自动同一诊断。

00:17:43.608 --> 00:17:55.776
The de Winter description combines upsloping precordial ST depression with prominent symmetric T waves. It can indicate serious coronary occlusion without ordinary precordial elevation.
de Winter描述结合胸前上斜ST压低及突出对称T，可在无普通胸前抬高时提示严重冠脉闭塞。

00:17:55.776 --> 00:18:07.224
Wellens is a clinical pattern with characteristic anterior biphasic or deep symmetric T changes and a relevant recent symptom history, not a label for any inverted T.
Wellens是结合相关近期症状史及特征前方双相或深对称T的临床模式，不是所有倒T的名称。

00:18:07.224 --> 00:18:18.096
Describe the real findings and escalate the risk through the actual pathway. Do not add a provocative exercise test or declare a specific vessel from a cartoon.
应描述真实发现并依实际路径升级风险，不能加诱发运动测试或从简图宣布特定血管。

00:18:18.096 --> 00:18:29.136
Widespread depression with a V R elevation can represent high-risk diffuse subendocardial ischemia. It is not proof that every patient has an acute left-main occlusion.
广泛压低伴aVR抬高，可代表高风险弥漫心内膜下缺血，但不证明人人都有急性左主干闭塞。

00:18:29.136 --> 00:18:40.752
Severe coronary disease and systemic supply-demand mismatch can both contribute. Hemorrhage, hypoxia or a compensatory fast rate may be central to the current problem.
严重冠脉病及全身供需失衡都可参与。出血、低氧或代偿快率，可能是当前核心。

00:18:40.752 --> 00:18:51.912
Treat the actual reversible threats and support perfusion while escalating ischemic concern. Do not reflexively slow a bleeding patient because the tracing has a fast rate.
应处理真实可逆威胁、支持灌注，同时升级缺血担忧。不能因图上快率，就反射性给出血者降速。

00:18:51.912 --> 00:19:02.904
Communicate the pattern, patient state and response rather than a falsely certain anatomy. The receiving team needs both the ECG and the physiological explanation.
应沟通模式、患者状态及反应，不给错误确定解剖。接收团队既需ECG，也需生理解释。

00:19:02.904 --> 00:19:14.424
Repeat through the indicated pathway when symptoms recur, physiology changes or concern remains. A single nondiagnostic ECG is not the final story.
症状复发、生理变化或担忧持续时，应依指征路径复查。一次无诊断性ECG，不是最终故事。

00:19:14.424 --> 00:19:24.528
Use comparable placement and note supplemental positions. A difference caused by moving electrodes must not be silently called dynamic ischemia.
应使用可比定位并注明补充位置。电极移动造成差别，不能悄悄称动态缺血。

00:19:24.528 --> 00:19:34.080
Preserve acquisition time, symptom state and intervention sequence. An earlier transient finding may remain important after it resolves.
需保采集时间、症状状态及干预顺序。早先短暂发现即使消失，仍可能重要。

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:44.976
Communicate concern promptly and seek an expert over-read when needed. Do not wait for every label to become certain while an unstable patient deteriorates.
应及时沟通担忧，需要时寻专家复读。不能患者恶化时，仍等每个标签都确定。

00:19:44.976 --> 00:19:55.344
Maintain primary airway, breathing and circulation care while interpreting. A beautiful trace is not useful if obtaining it displaced needed support.
判读时必须维持主要ABC照护。取得漂亮图若挤掉所需支持，就没有价值。

00:19:55.344 --> 00:20:06.096
Ask whether the rhythm or ischemia causes the low perfusion, contributes to it or reflects compensation for another process. The same rate can mean different things.
应问心律缺血是在造成、参与低灌注，还是代偿其他过程。同一频率可有不同意义。

00:20:06.096 --> 00:20:15.528
A traumatic or bleeding patient can also have coronary disease. Do not let the cardiac label hide uncontrolled hemorrhage or an airway problem.
创伤或出血者也可有冠脉病。不能让心脏标签掩盖未控出血或气道问题。

00:20:15.528 --> 00:20:25.608
Escalate through the actual regional system with an accurate description of both threats. You do not need angiographic certainty to request needed capability.
应依真实区域系统升级，准确描述两种威胁。请求所需能力，不必先有造影确定。

00:20:25.608 --> 00:20:39.192
A sixty-nine-year-old at a garden exhibition develops sudden breathlessness and sweating without a classic pain description. Assess function and obtain a useful ECG rather than dismissing the presentation.
园艺展中69岁者突然气促出汗，没有经典疼痛描述。应评功能并取有用ECG，不能轻视表现。

00:20:39.192 --> 00:20:52.272
Assume the reliable tracing shows horizontal depression in V One to V Three with supportive R and T features. State posterior ischemic concern without calling the finding specific proof.
假设可靠记录有V1至V3水平压低及支持R和T特征。应说明后壁缺血怀疑，不称特异证明。

00:20:52.272 --> 00:21:04.512
Obtain indicated trained supplemental views while assessing cardiac failure, embolism and other dangerous causes. Continue support and preserve the original trace and times.
应依指征取受训补充导联，同时评心衰、栓塞及其他危险原因，持续支持并保原图时间。

00:21:04.512 --> 00:21:16.824
If the extra trace remains nondiagnostic but symptoms or instability persist, escalate the concern and seek review. A negative extra view is not permission to stop caring.
若补图仍无诊断性，但症状或不稳定持续，需升级担忧并寻复核。额外图阴性，不许可停止照护。

00:21:16.824 --> 00:21:28.800
A sixty-three-year-old at a ferry terminal has weakness, chest pressure and poor perfusion. The ECG has the adult LBBB morphology, but no prior tracing is available.
码头63岁者无力、胸部压迫且灌注差。ECG有成人LBBB形态，但取不到旧图。

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:39.000
Do not label it definitely new, and do not diagnose MI from LBBB alone. Review the whole trace and the specific concerning ST relationships.
不能标确定新发，也不能仅凭LBBB诊断梗死。应看全图及特定可疑ST关系。

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:49.848
Use the referenced criteria carefully, state any measurement uncertainty and consider other contributors to shock. A negative result would not make this patient stable.
应谨慎用引用标准、说明测量不确定，并考虑休克其他参与因素。即使阴性，也不能使此患者稳定。

00:21:49.848 --> 00:22:02.760
Continue appropriate support and urgent notification/consultation through the actual pathway. Report LBBB of unknown age with the observed ischemic concern and current physiology.
应持续适当支持，并依真实路径紧急通知咨询。需报告新旧未知LBBB、观察的缺血担忧及当前生理。

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:12.888
The school target is a complete pre-alert within sixty seconds. Start with the unit, patient and immediate threat so the receiver can allocate attention.
学校目标为六十秒内完整预警。应先单位、患者及即时威胁，让接收方能分配注意。

00:22:12.888 --> 00:22:26.112
Give symptom timing, current perfusion and the actual abnormal leads or conduction context. State posterior concern or LBBB of unknown age rather than invented certainty.
需给症状时间、当前灌注及真实异常导联或传导背景。应说后壁怀疑或新旧未知LBBB，不编确定。

00:22:26.112 --> 00:22:35.400
Report treatment already given and response, including adverse change. Separate a possible intervention from one actually administered.
应报已给治疗及反应，包括不良变化，并区分可能干预与实际已给。

00:22:35.400 --> 00:22:46.224
Finish with ETA, capability required and confirmation of the plan. The clock tests organized communication, not speed at the expense of the key risk.
最后给到达时间、所需能力并确认计划。计时检验有序沟通，不是牺牲关键风险换语速。

00:22:46.224 --> 00:22:56.592
You should now explain why anterior depression may raise posterior concern, where the additional views belong and why high lateral is not always an equivalent.
现在应能解释前方压低为何可疑后壁、补导联位置，以及为何高侧壁不总是等价型。

00:22:56.592 --> 00:23:06.144
Distinguish adult RBBB and LBBB using duration and complete morphology, and distinguish bundle disease from atrioventricular block.
应依时限及完整形态区分成人RBBB及LBBB，并分清束支病与房室阻滞。

00:23:06.144 --> 00:23:15.576
Reconstruct concordance, original weights and the proportional modification, including the S-wave denominator and the limits of a negative result.
应重建同向、原权重及比例改良，包括S波分母及阴性局限。

00:23:15.576 --> 00:23:27.960
Finally connect the finding to the current patient, serial evidence and an actionable pre-alert. The integrated workshop next combines these decisions with ROSC deterioration and trauma.
最后应把发现连到当前患者、串联证据及可行动预警。下一整合课将结合ROSC恶化及创伤决策。
